    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity matters challenges players to navigate a vast universe using gravity as their primary tool. Players must slingshot around planets, space stations, and even black holes to complete objectives while managing their limited fuel and life support.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the gravity, slingshot around obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Borrow&quot; alien tech to fold space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to the galactic core to uncover its secret!</p></li></ul>",
